  - Key: project.assets.game.prefab.pieces_so_tooltip_bg_description
    Values:
    - "<b>Private soldier</b>\nWalk up to 8 spaces vertically or horizontally"
    - "<b>Soldado raso</b>\nAnda at\u00E9 8 casas na vertical ou na horizontal"
    - "<b>Soldado raso</b>\nSe mueve hasta 8 casillas en vertical u horizontal"
    - "<b>Einfacher Soldat</b>\nZieht bis zu 8 Felder vertikal oder horizontal"
    - "<b>Simple soldat</b>\nSe d\u00E9place jusqu'\u00E0 8 cases \u00E0 la verticale ou \u00E0 l'horizontale"
    - "<b>Soldato semplice</b>\nSi muove fino a 8 caselle in verticale o in orizzontale"
    - "<b>\u4E00\u822C\u5175</b>\n\u7E26\u307E\u305F\u306F\u6A2A\u306B\u6700\u59278\u30DE\u30B9\u79FB\u52D5\u3067\u304D\u308B"
    - "<b>\u5217\u5175</b>\n\u53EF\u6CBF\u5782\u76F4\u6216\u6C34\u5E73\u65B9\u5411\u79FB\u52A8\u6700\u591A8\u683C"
    - "<b>\u5217\u5175</b>\n\u53EF\u6CBF\u5782\u76F4\u6216\u6C34\u5E73\u65B9\u5411\u79FB\u52D5\u6700\u591A8\u683C"
  - Key: project.assets.game.prefab.pieces_sp_tooltip_bg_description
    Values:
    - "<b>Assassin</b>\nThe assassin manages to defeat the enemy king, but loses to any other soldier"
    - "<b>Assassino</b>\nO assassino consegue derrotar o rei inimigo, mas perde para qualquer outro soldado"
    - "<b>Asesino</b>\nEl asesino logra derrotar al rey enemigo, pero pierde contra cualquier otro soldado"
    - "<b>Assassine</b>\nDer Assassine kann den gegnerischen K\u00F6nig besiegen, verliert aber gegen jeden anderen Soldaten"
    - "<b>Assassin</b>\nL'assassin peut vaincre le roi ennemi, mais perd contre tout autre soldat"
    - "<b>Assassino</b>\nL'assassino riesce a sconfiggere il re nemico, ma perde contro qualsiasi altro soldato"
    - "<b>\u6697\u6BBA\u8005</b>\n\u6575\u306E\u738B\u3092\u5012\u305B\u308B\u304C\u3001\u4ED6\u306E\u3069\u306E\u5175\u58EB\u306B\u3082\u8CA0\u3051\u308B"
    - "<b>\u523A\u5BA2</b>\n\u523A\u5BA2\u80FD\u591F\u51FB\u8D25\u654C\u65B9\u56FD\u738B\uFF0C\u4F46\u4F1A\u8F93\u7ED9\u5176\u4ED6\u4EFB\u4F55\u58EB\u5175"
    - "<b>\u523A\u5BA2</b>\n\u523A\u5BA2\u80FD\u5920\u64CA\u6557\u6575\u65B9\u570B\u738B\uFF0C\u4F46\u6703\u8F38\u7D66\u5176\u4ED6\u4EFB\u4F55\u58EB\u5175"
  - Key: project.assets.game.prefab.pieces_te_tooltip_bg_description
    Values:
    - "<b>Treasure</b>\nIf the enemy finds your treasure you lose"
    - "<b>Tesouro</b>\nSe o inimigo encontrar seu tesouro voc\u00EA perde"
    - "<b>Tesoro</b>\nSi el enemigo encuentra tu tesoro, pierdes"
    - "<b>Schatz</b>\nFindet der Gegner deinen Schatz, verlierst du"
    - "<b>Tr\u00E9sor</b>\nSi l'ennemi trouve votre tr\u00E9sor, vous perdez"
    - "<b>Tesoro</b>\nSe il nemico trova il tuo tesoro, perdi"
    - "<b>\u5B9D\u7269</b>\n\u6575\u306B\u5B9D\u7269\u3092\u898B\u3064\u3051\u3089\u308C\u308B\u3068\u8CA0\u3051"
    - "<b>\u5B9D\u85CF</b>\n\u5982\u679C\u654C\u4EBA\u627E\u5230\u4F60\u7684\u5B9D\u85CF\uFF0C\u4F60\u5C31\u8F93\u4E86"
    - "<b>\u5BF6\u85CF</b>\n\u5982\u679C\u6575\u4EBA\u627E\u5230\u4F60\u7684\u5BF6\u85CF\uFF0C\u4F60\u5C31\u8F38\u4E86"
